WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.058 --> 00:00:09.201
In Milly Pond there lived a shy turtle called Tilly.

2
00:00:10.061 --> 00:00:14.403
Tilly the turtle had no friends, because she was shy.

3
00:00:15.324 --> 00:00:22.208
If anyone came by to talk or play, she would duck in her shell and wait until they

4
00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:23.108
went away.

5
00:00:24.509 --> 00:00:28.351
Then one day Freddy the frog came swimming by.

6
00:00:28.371 --> 00:00:32.281
"Tilly, don't hide in your shell.

7
00:00:33.001 --> 00:00:34.382
I just want to play."

8
00:00:35.463 --> 00:00:37.604
But Tilly was too shy.

9
00:00:37.624 --> 00:00:40.005
"No. No.

10
00:00:40.245 --> 00:00:41.446
Just go away."

11
00:00:43.567 --> 00:00:45.808
Freddy the frog had many friends.

12
00:00:46.248 --> 00:00:53.732
He knew all the fish, he liked the dragonflies, he joked with the ladybugs, and he hung out

13
00:00:53.812 --> 00:00:58.855
with the bees, but his best friend was Betty the butterfly.

14
00:00:58.875 --> 00:01:00.436
"Hi, Betty.

15
00:01:00.928 --> 00:01:01.829
How are you?"

16
00:01:01.849 --> 00:01:04.470
"Hi, Freddy, I'm fine.

17
00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:05.491
How are you?"

18
00:01:05.511 --> 00:01:09.973
"I don't think Tilly the turtle likes me.

19
00:01:10.613 --> 00:01:17.317
Whenever I ask her to come out and play, she hides in her shell and won't come out

20
00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:19.338
until I go away."

21
00:01:19.358 --> 00:01:22.480
"Oh, Freddy.

22
00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:26.822
I think Tilly likes you, but she is very shy."

23
00:01:26.843 --> 00:01:29.144
"I don't understand.

24
00:01:29.816 --> 00:01:32.198
Why is Tilly the turtle shy?"

25
00:01:32.218 --> 00:01:35.801
"I don't know, but I have a story."

26
00:01:35.821 --> 00:01:39.424
"Oh, I like stories."

27
00:01:39.444 --> 00:01:45.510
"Well, many caterpillars are shy because caterpillars think they are ugly.

28
00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:52.616
I have known many caterpillars who wrap themselves up all winter, and hide away."

29
00:01:52.636 --> 00:01:56.179
"When it's cold, I hide away too."

30
00:01:56.199 --> 00:02:03.876
"Yes, but caterpillars are very lonely all winter, and their loneliness changes them."

31
00:02:03.896 --> 00:02:05.978
"Oh, I see.

32
00:02:06.598 --> 00:02:09.640
When I hide away, I'm with my family.

33
00:02:10.220 --> 00:02:13.022
It's hard to be lonely in my family."

34
00:02:13.042 --> 00:02:22.349
"In the spring, the caterpillars come out, but they are no longer ugly caterpillars who are shy; they

35
00:02:22.449 --> 00:02:25.471
are instead, beautiful butterflies."

36
00:02:25.491 --> 00:02:30.791
"So, should I wait for Tilly to turn into a butterfly?"

37
00:02:30.811 --> 00:02:38.597
"No, you should keep asking her to come out and play because one day she'll come out of

38
00:02:38.657 --> 00:02:42.741
her shell, just like a butterfly comes out of a cocoon."

39
00:02:44.062 --> 00:02:51.468
Freddy liked Betty best because Betty was smart, and Freddy kept asking Tilly to come out and play.

40
00:02:52.428 --> 00:02:59.181
One day when he was just swimming by, he said to Tilly, "You can't have any friends if

41
00:02:59.241 --> 00:03:00.742
you hide in your shell.

42
00:03:01.363 --> 00:03:04.465
I think you should come on out and give it a try."

43
00:03:05.446 --> 00:03:09.088
Tilly was lonely and she knew that Freddy was right.

44
00:03:09.889 --> 00:03:13.831
She had no friends because she always hid in her shell.

45
00:03:14.872 --> 00:03:22.257
So, Tilly poked her head out and looked all around, and she was amazed at how many new

46
00:03:22.377 --> 00:03:23.538
friends she found.

47
00:03:28.344 --> 00:03:33.328
If you are shy and lonely, then learn a lesson from Tilly the turtle.

48
00:03:33.949 --> 00:03:37.572
To find a friend, you need to come out of your shell.
